      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate's opening gross claims reserves at 1 January 2020 were GBP 1,683.739m. During 2020 there was an overall adverse prioryear runoff deviation (net) of GBP 20.059m (treated here as a strengthening of reserves), driven by adverse development in a number of classes including large single losses in Reinsurance and Energy and adverse development in delegated underwriting; the year was also impacted by natural catastrophe frequency (notably hurricanes) and COVID19 related claims. No explicit gross prioryear movement note was found in the statements, so the movement reported above is taken from the reported runoff deviation (net) table and is therefore a net figure and used as a fallback.",
